{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "R-index-top-in", "R-pinky-top", "L-middle-home"],
  "note": "After T3 chord {a,b,d,e}={N,Q,W,Y}: d=R-pinky-top=N, e=L-middle-home=Y, and {a,b}={Q,W}. From earlier {a,b,c}={P,Q,W} => c=R-index-top-in=P. Thus a=L-pinky-top is Q or W; b=L-index-top-in is the other. Now press {a,c,d,e}={L-pinky-top,R-index-top-in,R-pinky-top,L-middle-home} to resolve a."
}

{
  "presses": [
    "L-index-home-in",
    "L-pinky-top",
    "R-pinky-top",
    "R-index-top-in"
  ],
  "note": "From T6 (after rotation swap): L-middle-home=N; R-pinky-top=Y. Also deduced via {L-pinky-top,R-index-top-in}={Q,R} and T6 {L/R-index-top-in}={W,R}: R-index-top-in=R, L-index-top-in=W, L-pinky-top=Q. T7 press L-index-home-in + {L-pinky-top=Q,R-pinky-top=Y,R-index-top-in=R} to read L-index-home-in letter from remaining symbol."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-ring-top", "L-pinky-top", "R-pinky-top", "L-ring-home"],
  "note": "T9: press {L-ring-top, L-pinky-top, R-pinky-top, L-ring-home}. Known now: L-pinky-top=B; R-pinky-top=Y; L-ring-home=W; L-index-home-in=Q; R-index-top-in=R; L-middle-home=N. Also {L-ring-top,R-index-home-in}={J,S}; L-index-top-in=unknown x. After symbols: subtract {B,Y,W} to get L-ring-top=J or S; other goes to R-index-home-in. Then apply T9 rotation notice to update any rotated keys (may include ring-top/ring-home)."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-ring-home", "L-pinky-top", "R-index-top-in", "R-ring-home"],
  "note": "Known: L-pinky-top=B; L-ring-home=W; L-ring-top=J; R-pinky-top=Y; L-middle-home=N; L-index-home-in=Q; R-index-top-in=R; R-index-home-in=S. Last rotation involved {L-index-bottom-in,L-index-home} (no letter values yet). T10 press {L-ring-home, L-pinky-top, R-index-top-in, R-ring-home}; deduce R-ring-home = the 4th symbol not in {B,W,R}."
}

{
  "presses": [
    "L-ring-bottom",
    "R-index-bottom-in",
    "R-index-home",
    "R-ring-top"
  ],
  "note": "T17: {L-pinky-bottom,L-index-bottom-in,R-index-bottom-in,R-index-top}={A,F,H,M}; with T16 {L-pinky-bottom,L-ring-bottom,L-index-top,L-index-bottom}={G,L,M,U} => L-pinky-bottom=M. So {A,F,H} perm on {L-index-bottom-in,R-index-bottom-in,R-index-top} (R-index-top∉{R}). Also {G,L,U} perm on {L-ring-bottom,L-index-top,L-index-bottom}. Next planned: T19 {L-index-top,R-index-top,R-index-bottom,R-middle-top}; T20 {L-index-bottom,R-index-home,R-index-bottom,R-middle-home}."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-index-top", "R-index-top", "R-index-bottom", "R-middle-top"],
  "locks": {
    "L-ring-bottom": "L",
    "R-index-bottom-in": "A"
  },
  "note": "Known: L-pinky-bottom=M; L-ring-bottom=L; R-index-bottom-in=A. From T17: {F,H} perm on {L-index-bottom-in,R-index-top}; {G,U} perm on {L-index-top,L-index-bottom}. From last chord (no rot): {O,V} perm on {R-index-home,R-ring-top}. Next: use symbols from this press {L-index-top,R-index-top,R-index-bottom,R-middle-top} to finish mapping for those keys, then guess."
}
